{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "今天是公布考试结果的日子。", "text_idx": 310, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "休息时间走廊上挤满了来看名次表的学生。", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“濑名同学还是堂堂的第一名呢～”", "text_idx": 297, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 342, "voice": "_ht1745", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不愧是她。其他人的名次也都有上升吗？”", "text_idx": 249, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 326, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我立刻就找到自己的名字。", "text_idx": 322, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "比上次考试的名次更高了。", "text_idx": 328, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然后隔壁。", "text_idx": 330, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "是乾纱凪的名字。", "text_idx": 327, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "总分一样的同名次。", "text_idx": 317, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪跟濑名同学站在稍远的地方。", "text_idx": 338, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哎呀哎呀～看起来名次好像有误呢～找不到安洁的名字喔？”", "text_idx": 263, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 315, "voice": "_ag3970", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“安洁的名字在这里。”", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 331, "voice": "_ar6577", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“爱理同学真是的，爱开玩笑～上次考试成为能干女仆的安洁，怎么会在那种位置……”", "text_idx": 298, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 39, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 315, "voice": "_ag3971", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那种……位置……”", "text_idx": 306, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 315, "voice": "_ag3972", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“没有持续努力所以会变成这样。因为人类，堕落只在一转眼……”", "text_idx": 295, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 331, "voice": "_ar6578", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔！这样安洁又变回糟糕女仆……”", "text_idx": 266, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 315, "voice": "_ag3973", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安洁的名次往下掉了。", "text_idx": 316, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因为上次考试有濑名同学的帮忙吧。", "text_idx": 313, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“新吾跟小乾同名次啊。而且还比上次进步，真厉害啊～”", "text_idx": 286, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 342, "voice": "_ht1746", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“其实这次我本来没什么自信。”", "text_idx": 260, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 326, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 238, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 335, "voice": "_sn4185", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪也看到了自己的名字，表情很高兴。", "text_idx": 336, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然想跟她说话，但现在就忍耐吧。", "text_idx": 339, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们约好在教室要表现得生疏一点。", "text_idx": 319, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不过，身为知道内情的人，现在的你和小乾怎么说呢……”", "text_idx": 252, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 342, "voice": "_ht1747", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，我知道你想说什么。”", "text_idx": 271, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 326, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我自己也觉得很不适应。", "text_idx": 324, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在交往前我们还能一起看着名次表交谈。", "text_idx": 314, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是现在却只能远远地交换视线。", "text_idx": 312, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“果然这样很不自然吧。”", "text_idx": 291, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 326, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不，我觉得你很厉害。”", "text_idx": 253, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 342, "voice": "_ht1748", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“为什么？”", "text_idx": 256, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 326, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“一般人第一次交到女朋友都会兴奋到不行吧？”", "text_idx": 246, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 342, "voice": "_ht1749", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“但是你却能克制自己，我觉得很厉害。”", "text_idx": 257, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 342, "voice": "_ht1750", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……正好相反，因为是第一次交到的女朋友吧。”", "text_idx": 243, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 326, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯？”", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 342, "voice": "_ht1751", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我想珍惜那个女孩。虽然身为男人会想很多其他的事情啦。”", "text_idx": 285, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 326, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不过我想慢慢地，两个人一起前进。”", "text_idx": 251, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 326, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……瓜生新吾，你到来这里跪坐。”", "text_idx": 244, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 335, "voice": "_sn4186", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是。”", "text_idx": 287, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 326, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "放学后教室里只剩下我们两人。", "text_idx": 325, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "还想着终于可以好好跟她说话了，却被她命令跪坐。", "text_idx": 341, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“为什么在教室里叫我纱凪？还在大家面前握住我的手？”", "text_idx": 255, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 335, "voice": "_sn4187", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……因为纱凪一看到我就逃走？”", "text_idx": 241, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 326, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“当然要逃啊！被你那么近距离注视……”", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 335, "voice": "_sn4188", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“连看你都不行吗？”", "text_idx": 303, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 326, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那来确认一下，你看着我的眼睛。”", "text_idx": 305, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 335, "voice": "_sn4189", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯。”", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 326, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我照纱凪说的凝视她。", "text_idx": 321, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 238, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 335, "voice": "_sn4190", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……果然不行，连看也禁止。”", "text_idx": 242, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 335, "voice": "_sn4191", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“纱凪真严厉啊。”", "text_idx": 299, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 326, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“应该说，你的眼神太温柔了！被那种眼神盯着看我也会很困扰的……”", "text_idx": 277, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 335, "voice": "_sn4192", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不能改成更冰冷一点的眼神吗？”", "text_idx": 250, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 335, "voice": "_sn4193", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不会想俯视我、骂我吗？”", "text_idx": 247, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 335, "voice": "_sn4194", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，不会。”", "text_idx": 270, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 326, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊～真是的！我会沉迷其中的不准看着我笑！”", "text_idx": 268, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 335, "voice": "_sn4195", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“听好了，现在开始练习骂我。”", "text_idx": 261, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 335, "voice": "_sn4196", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“来，恨我吧。尽管骂没关系！”", "text_idx": 290, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 335, "voice": "_sn4197", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那个，一定要这么做吗？”", "text_idx": 304, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 326, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“当然！在教室里温柔注视我的那个扭曲性格，我要在这里把它导正过来！”", "text_idx": 281, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 335, "voice": "_sn4198", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……明明根本没有扭曲啊。", "text_idx": 308, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看来我现在必须骂纱凪才行。", "text_idx": 333, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“来啊，怎么了？快点骂我啊！”", "text_idx": 289, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 335, "voice": "_sn4199", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“就算你叫我骂你，但是面对喜欢的人我想不出该骂什么。”", "text_idx": 276, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 326, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“有很多吧！”", "text_idx": 288, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 335, "voice": "_sn4200", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“像你这种又丑胸部又小的女人，没有活着的价值！”", "text_idx": 259, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 335, "voice": "_sn4201", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“个性很差、又不性感，成为你男朋友的男人真是太不幸了！”", "text_idx": 254, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 335, "voice": "_sn4202", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“模仿刚才那些就好了，你说说看。”", "text_idx": 292, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 335, "voice": "_sn4203", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这有点……”", "text_idx": 302, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 326, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我不会生气的你说吧。不是只有温柔才算男人，搞不好我会因为被骂又更喜欢新吾喔？”", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 40, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 335, "voice": "_sn4204", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 238, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 326, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然我不认同，但现在似乎是我不得不说的状况。", "text_idx": 340, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那，好吧……”", "text_idx": 307, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 326, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我清了清喉咙。", "text_idx": 320, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然后。", "text_idx": 329, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“像你这种又丑胸部又小的女人，没有活着的价值！”", "text_idx": 259, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 326, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“个性很差、又不性感，成为你男朋友的男人真是太不幸了！”", "text_idx": 254, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 326, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……那种事我自己也知道啊。”", "text_idx": 245, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 335, "voice": "_sn4205", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不对不对不对！既然会这么消沉，为什么要让我说！？”", "text_idx": 248, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 326, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“应该说，你说得未免也太放入感情了吧？”", "text_idx": 278, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 335, "voice": "_sn4206", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“你想太多了。”", "text_idx": 258, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 326, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……唉，算了。我明天开始也来骂新吾好了。”", "text_idx": 239, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 335, "voice": "_sn4207", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“渣虫、渣虫，新吾是渣虫！嗯，就是这个。”", "text_idx": 296, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 335, "voice": "_sn4208", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好怀念。”", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 326, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊，喂！不准高兴，渣虫！！”", "text_idx": 267, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 335, "voice": "_sn4209", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "现在不管她说什么我都忍不住笑意。", "text_idx": 332, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“总之，我们先去社团吧。”", "text_idx": 283, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 326, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔、嗯。你脚麻了吧？抱歉，逼你跪坐这么久……”", "text_idx": 264, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 335, "voice": "_sn4210", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“没事的。”", "text_idx": 293, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 326, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔啊。”", "text_idx": 265, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 335, "voice": "_sn4211", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我站起来拍拍纱凪的头，拿起桌上的书包。", "text_idx": 323, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“走吧。”", "text_idx": 300, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 326, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……嗯♪”", "text_idx": 240, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 335, "voice": "_sn4212", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪背对着夕颜，笑容满面牵着我的手。", "text_idx": 337, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呐，新吾。”", "text_idx": 262, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 335, "voice": "_sn4213", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯？”", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 326, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“跟我交往后的新吾，没有不幸吧？”", "text_idx": 301, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 335, "voice": "_sn4214", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“当然。”", "text_idx": 279, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 326, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 238, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 335, "voice": "_sn4215", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“怎么了？”", "text_idx": 282, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 326, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“没事，没什么。”", "text_idx": 294, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 335, "voice": "_sn4216", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好，今天也要努力做社团活动啰～”", "text_idx": 274, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 335, "voice": "_sn4217", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
